  "sourceTitle": "Marinated Sliced Duck",
  "sourceText": "Marinated Sliced Duck\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Saturday, December 5, 2009 - 11:33pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 kg rock sugar\n100 grams sar keong\n50 grams tong kwai\n100 grams san cha (sliced)\n100 grams cho kor\n100 grams dried sar keong\n100 grams lo hon ko\n700 grams salt\n100 grams chicken bouillon (chicken essence)\n100 ml mei kwai lo wine\n50 grams bay leaf (heong yip)\n250 grams duck meat\n40 grams garlic\n20 grams vinegar\n10 grams red chilli\n\nPreparation\n\n1 MethodBOIL all the spices together for 30 minutes. Put the duck meat into the mixture and let boil for another 30 minutes. 2 Remove duck. Let cool, slice and serve.",
